{"3457040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Saber Arena", "steam_appid": 3457040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Saber Arena is </i>a 6 degrees of freedom fast-paced roguelike space shooter with 20 levels of increasingly difficulty, including achievements and power ups you can get to claw your way to ultimate victory. It also includes multiplayer mode with death match and team deathmatch across multiple maps.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/359b6d0fac83bf885de6c4d269627f23.poster.avif?t=1781095648\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/359b6d0fac83bf885de6c4d269627f23.webm?t=1781095648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/359b6d0fac83bf885de6c4d269627f23.mp4?t=1781095648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> With each wave, enemies grow more powerful, introducing new attack patterns, ship types, and environmental hazards to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/Screenshot_2025-02-20_at_01.25.39.png?t=1781095648\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Upgrades:</strong> Collect  XP to unlock powerful weapons, ship enhancements, and abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/08a46994a1b519929a312d64fe7dd6ab.avif?t=1781095648\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras_big/08a46994a1b519929a312d64fe7dd6ab.avif?t=1781095648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Take on massive, screen-filling bosses on the final wave wave, each with unique mechanics and devastating attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you emerge victorious and conquer all 20 waves, or will the void claim your ship and crew? The fate of the galaxy rests in your hands, Captain. Prepare to fire up the engines, lock onto your targets, and embrace the chaos of the roguelike cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Saber Arena is </i>a 6 degrees of freedom fast-paced roguelike space shooter with 20 levels of increasingly difficulty, including achievements and power ups you can get to claw your way to ultimate victory. It also includes multiplayer mode with death match and team deathmatch across multiple maps.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/359b6d0fac83bf885de6c4d269627f23.poster.avif?t=1781095648\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/359b6d0fac83bf885de6c4d269627f23.webm?t=1781095648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/359b6d0fac83bf885de6c4d269627f23.mp4?t=1781095648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progressive Difficulty:</strong> With each wave, enemies grow more powerful, introducing new attack patterns, ship types, and environmental hazards to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/Screenshot_2025-02-20_at_01.25.39.png?t=1781095648\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable Upgrades:</strong> Collect  XP to unlock powerful weapons, ship enhancements, and abilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras/08a46994a1b519929a312d64fe7dd6ab.avif?t=1781095648\" alt=\"\"data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/extras_big/08a46994a1b519929a312d64fe7dd6ab.avif?t=1781095648 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Take on massive, screen-filling bosses on the final wave wave, each with unique mechanics and devastating attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you emerge victorious and conquer all 20 waves, or will the void claim your ship and crew? The fate of the galaxy rests in your hands, Captain. Prepare to fire up the engines, lock onto your targets, and embrace the chaos of the roguelike cosmos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "3D action roguelike in space where you battle hordes of aliens with five unique weapon classes. Gather XP, choose upgrades to create unique builds, and beat the final boss — or jump into PvP, picking up diverse weapons from pickups and fighting other players.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/header.jpg?t=1781095648", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/d0df725b6737540aa339b62f4f53648b63fe6862/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781095648", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3457040/d0df725b6737540aa339b62f4f53648b63fe6862/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781095648", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1650ti</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["Multiversal"], "publishers": ["Multiversal"], "demos": [{"appid": 3537900, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "29", "description": "Massively Multiplayer"}, {"id": "37", "description": "Free To Play"}], "scre